sequenceDiagram
  participant U as Learner
  participant VM as ExecutableLessonVM
  participant API as api.mimo.org
  participant WS as wss://api.mimo.org/v1/run/socket
  U->>VM: run
  alt REST
    VM->>API: POST /v1/code/runfiles {files}
    API-->>VM: {consoleOutput, error, hasPassed, hostedProjectUrl, tests}
  else WebSocket
    VM->>WS: connect (Sec-WebSocket-Protocol: authorization.bearer.<token>)
    WS-->>VM: streamed output
  end
